; --- the delays of the transient decks, absolute crossing times in femtoseconds ----------------------------
; ngspice .meas prints six digits, so these have a resolution of 1 ps at 1 us. The delay of an edge is the crossing minus the time of the edge
; (the start of step 0 at t = dt, the start of step 200 at t = 201 dt): 2 ns and 402 ns at 10 pF, 100 ps and 20.1 ns at 500 fF.
